  "project_description": "Enhances the layout builder block selection UX by adding:\n\n - Custom configurable images per block.\n\n- Custom categories for all blocks.\n\n- Removes the extra click for \"inline blocks\", and merges those blocks with the\n\n system defined blocks.\n\n- Gives control to group blocks by categories and name each block as you want.\n\n- Allows adding reusable block content entities dynamically.\n\n- Allows opening the layout builder browser in a modal or in the default off-canvas.",
